WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:03.370
[music playing]

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:24.190
OFFICER HERNANDEZ: We're
going to have to take

00:00:24.257 --> 00:00:25.692
this back to the office.

00:00:25.759 --> 00:00:26.993
Yeah.

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:30.296
That box will not be going
to its final destination.

00:00:30.363 --> 00:00:32.432
I appreciate you
carrying the heavy stuff.

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:38.905
OFFICER HERNANDEZ: So
when it comes to firearms

00:00:38.972 --> 00:00:42.308
in particular, we have to
exert an extraordinary amount

00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:43.710
of caution dealing
with firearms,

00:00:43.777 --> 00:00:47.380
because we do not know if
they are loaded or not.

00:00:47.447 --> 00:00:49.182
So as a rule of thumb,
we always treat all

00:00:49.249 --> 00:00:50.784
firearms as if they're loaded.

00:00:53.953 --> 00:00:58.091
So we have a specific procedure
that we use in order to clear

00:00:58.158 --> 00:01:00.326
the weapon to make
sure that there

00:01:00.393 --> 00:01:03.696
isn't any incidental
discharges, any accidents,

00:01:03.763 --> 00:01:04.631
nothing of the sort.

00:01:09.035 --> 00:01:11.805
At least they're not loaded.

00:01:11.871 --> 00:01:14.374
A couple of pistols.

00:01:14.441 --> 00:01:16.709
It's a 30 round max.

00:01:16.776 --> 00:01:18.378
The glock.

00:01:18.445 --> 00:01:20.780
OFFICER HERNANDEZ: A lot
of accessories, grips--

00:01:23.283 --> 00:01:26.786
Appears to be a mini AK-47.

00:01:26.853 --> 00:01:29.189
This is a good seizure,
considering all the violence is

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:30.690
going on in Trinidad right now.

00:01:30.757 --> 00:01:33.426
It's always good to take
guns off the street.

00:01:33.493 --> 00:01:35.361
We don't really know to
whom it was going to.

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:37.697
A lot of times they used
fake names or aliases,

00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:39.699
but this is a good catch.

00:01:49.576 --> 00:01:53.246
It's most definitely
a good seizure.

00:01:53.313 --> 00:01:56.149
These were meant to cause
bodily harm and injury

00:01:56.216 --> 00:01:58.351
towards someone, whether
it be an innocent person

00:01:58.418 --> 00:02:00.220
or another narco.

00:02:00.286 --> 00:02:03.456
So the effort that we put
out there all together--

00:02:03.523 --> 00:02:06.926
it's worth it when you come
across something like this.

00:02:06.993 --> 00:02:08.461
We definitely save lives.

00:02:08.528 --> 00:02:11.798
[music playing]

